{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>第1986期商標公告顯示，小米SU9 LUX商標已進入初步審定階段，異議期限自2026年06月07日至2026年09月06日止。據多位博主分享，小米SU9 LUX就是此前曝光的小米SU7L車型，有望瞄準行政豪華旗艦市場。</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/1019/e7928e1f9004697.png\">\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/1019/8872e32b92ddf4a.png\">\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/1019/8bea5cc654b3b40.png\">\n</p>\n<p>據媒體此前報道，小米SU7L長軸轎車此前已多次曝光。消息源Hanschen2007於8月24日展示了一款正在進行路測的神秘小米偽裝車。相對於標準版 SU7，該車明顯看起來相對更長，有望為長軸距版小米SU7車型，旨在提升第二排空間表現，滿足對空間與舒適性有更高需求的用户羣體。</p>\n\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/1019/e7928e1f9004697.png\">\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/1019/8872e32b92ddf4a.png\">\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/1019/8bea5cc654b3b40.png\">\n</p>\n\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T05:19:53.834089+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":248,"images":6,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T05:10:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T08:57:57.257346+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T05:17:35.501296+00:00","content_hash":"13dd1721e76b2b6a963de4ea81437f0046ac3ad6b779703db4ce4ce26e4fe6e9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}